<title>NETHERLANDS: Bangert cuts Hagemeyer to hold.</title>
<headline>Bangert cuts Hagemeyer to hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 4 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Hagemeyer NV    124.00  Bangert Pointier</p>
<p>COMMENT: In our opinion Hagemeyer is now fairly valued and will be performing in line with the market in the medium term.</p>
<p>Based on the above and the very strong performance since our first buy recommendation we change our recommendation to hold.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	5.90		  10.1    2.00</p>
<p>    1996		   6.65     6.85     19.0    2.40</p>
<p>    1997		   7.60     7.75     16.6    2.75</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
